!!! oculus/session/shell.mat
!!! The session shell — top-level entry point for the Oculus desktop.
!!!
!!! The shell is the orchestrator: it creates the desktop context,
!!! initializes the compositor, input routing, and window manager,
!!! and drives the main event loop.

book oculus.session.shell

read everything from ny.lang.core
read everything from oculus.window.viewport
read everything from oculus.compositor.compositor
read everything from oculus.input.routing
read everything from oculus.appearance.appearance

!!! The shell's current state.

public shell-state begin choice
    when Uninitialized
    when Running
    when Shutting-down
end choice

!!! The session shell.

public session-shell begin record
    field state as shell-state
    field frame-revision as override long
    field event-count as override long
end record
